<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia statistics schedule end Dec.</title>
<headline>Australia statistics schedule end Dec.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Bureau of Statistics has scheduled the following figures for release mid December. Data are issued at 11.30 a.m. (0030 GMT).</p>
<p>Dates are subject to revision.</p>
<p>Oct 14 - Manufacturing Output Prices, August</p>
<p>Oct 17 - Manufacturing Input Prices, August</p>
<p>	     - Export Price Index, August</p>
<p>	     - Import Price Index, August</p>
<p>Oct 18 - Merchandise Imports, September</p>
<p>Oct 23 - Consumer Price Index, September quarter</p>
<p>Oct 24 - Average weekly ordinary time earnings, three months</p>
<p>		 to August, preliminary</p>
<p>Oct 25 - New Motor Vehicle Registrations, September</p>
<p>Oct 30 - Balance of Payments, September</p>
<p>Oct 31 - Retail Trade, September and September quarter</p>
<p>	     - Building Approvals, September.</p>
<p>Nov 01 - Retail sales, September</p>
<p>Nov 04 - Housing materials price index, September</p>
<p>	     - Building materials (ex housing) price index, Sept</p>
<p>Nov 07 - Labour force, October</p>
<p>Nov 11 - Housing finance, September</p>
<p>Nov 12 - Manufacturing Output prices, September</p>
<p>Nov 14 - Average weekly ordinary time earnings, three months</p>
<p>		 to August, final</p>
<p>Nov 15 - Manufacturing Input Prices, September</p>
<p>	     - Export Price Index, September</p>
<p>	     - Import Price Index</p>
<p>Nov 21 - Company profits, September quarter</p>
<p>Nov 25 - Private new capital expenditure, September quarter</p>
<p>Nov 29 - Balance of Payments, October</p>
<p>	     - New motor vehicle registrations, October</p>
<p>Dec 02 - Stocks and selected sales, September quarter</p>
<p>	     - Retail trade, October</p>
<p>	     - Building approvals, October</p>
<p>Dec 04 - National Accounts, September quarter</p>
<p>Dec 10 - Industrial Production Indexes, September quarter</p>
<p>	     - Balance of Payments, September quarter</p>
<p>Dec 11 - International Investment Position, December quarter</p>
<p>	     - Housing Finance, October</p>
<p>Dec 12 - Labour Force, November</p>
<p>	     - Manufacturing Output Prices, October</p>
<p>Dec 13 - Dwelling Unit Commencements, September quarter</p>
<p>Dec 16 - Manufacturing Input prices, October</p>
<p>	     - Export Price Index, October</p>
<p>	     - Import Price Index. October</p>
<p>Dec 24 - New Motor Vehicle Registrations, November</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
